      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured — observed tooling is standard (git, gh, npm/pnpm/npx, node, brew, cargo, composer, php, flutter, docker, tmux, stow, nvim)",
      "**Routine under this repo's prefix**: local dotfile linking and shell/editor config work under the repo checkout (e.g. `stow`) is routine; anything touching $HOME history files or ignored secret paths is not"
    ]
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true,
  "feedbackSurveyState": {
    "lastShownTime": 1754070465024
  }
}
